# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says. A CRLF checkout (Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true) otherwise builds runtime and shell files into dist/cli.js with CRLF, and goldens and fixtures
# compared byte for byte stop matching.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures that test CRLF input keep their CRLF bytes.
crlf.md -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
